# Terraform — provider cache, lock, and state are never committed here.
# (CI runs `terraform init` fresh; the lock would otherwise pin to one OS/arch.)
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform.lock.hcl
crash.log
crash.*.log

# impeccable design-skill scripts — vendored on install via `npx impeccable skills install`.
# The markdown guidance under .github/skills/impeccable/{SKILL.md,reference/} is committed;
# the detector + live-browser scripts are not, because they're 2MB of machinery that any
# contributor can regenerate with the install command.
.github/skills/impeccable/scripts/
